- **`.cu` files**: CUDA kernels with `__global__` functions (custom implementations)
- **`.cpp` files**: cuDNN/cuBLAS API calls (NO custom kernels)
- **`_binding.cpp` files**: PyTorch tensor handling and Python bindings

